@startuml fig7_state
!include _style.iuml
skinparam StateBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F2F7FC
title Figure 7 (Section 6.4). State Diagram: Household Program Status
[*] --> ACTIVE_COMPLIANT : household enrolled\n(seed / ingest)
state "ACTIVE_COMPLIANT\n(receiving grants)" as ACTIVE_COMPLIANT
state "FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW\n(waiting for dispatch)" as FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW
state "UNDER_INVESTIGATION\n(field visit assigned)" as UNDER_INVESTIGATION
state "NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY\n(15-day appeal window,\ngrants continue)" as NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY
state "GRADUATED\n(exits the program)" as GRADUATED

ACTIVE_COMPLIANT --> FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW : model assessment\nrisk score >= 70\n[no calamity hold, no 180-day cooldown]\n/ MODEL_FLAG_RAISED
FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW --> UNDER_INVESTIGATION : director dispatches a caseworker\nwho covers the barangay\n/ TASK_DISPATCHED
UNDER_INVESTIGATION --> UNDER_INVESTIGATION : caseworker submits report\n[photo hash ok, GPS within 250 m]\n/ REPORT_SUBMITTED
UNDER_INVESTIGATION --> ACTIVE_COMPLIANT : director keeps the household\n(report recommends RETAIN)\n/ BENEFICIARY_RETAINED
UNDER_INVESTIGATION --> NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY : director approves graduation\nand issues the notice\n/ BENEFICIARY_GRADUATED (notice)
NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY --> GRADUATED : 15 days pass with no appeal,\nor hearing outcome DENIED\n/ BENEFICIARY_GRADUATED
NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY --> ACTIVE_COMPLIANT : hearing outcome GRANTED\n/ BENEFICIARY_RETAINED
GRADUATED --> [*]
note right of NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY
  Filing an appeal pauses graduation
  (APPEAL_FILED) until the hearing
  outcome is recorded.
end note
note left of ACTIVE_COMPLIANT
  After a retention, the model may not
  flag the household again for 180 days.
end note
note bottom of FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW
  Every arrow is one database transaction
  that also writes one SHA-256 audit block.
  Any other move is refused
  (INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION).
end note
@enduml
